        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass 4\" x 16\" Door Pull Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCommon size door pull plate primarily used in restaurants, warehouses and stores, but are popular in homes as well. The plate is 4\" wide and 16\" long; and is made of .050\" thick high quality solid brass for longevity. While the grip is 8-5/8\" with a 3/4\" diameter. It is made out of solid brass with a polished brass finish. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PPH4016-Specifications.gif?v=1704354644\" width\"416\" height=\"294\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Brushed Stainless Steel 4\" x 16\" Door Pull Plate Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4\" x 16\"Brass Door Pull Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 4\"\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Height: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
